**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use meatshields and anything with more than 370 range, such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], or use units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] if they are strong enough.

